This folder contains the final models as described in the CIE SAFE document.

Model 25.12_1Reg_Cont is the final continuity model from 2025, updated with data through the end of 2025 (matching the data available for the remaining 2026 models).

Model 26.1_1Reg is the final single region, panmictic assessment model that uses the 'carryover' extrapolation method for the NOAA Lonline Survey index.
                                                                                                          
Model 26.2_FAA is the final fleets-as-areas (FAA) model, which disaggregates the NOAA Longline Survey into regional fleets (Bering Sea, Aleutian Islands, Gulf of Alaska) and fits regional indices and age compositions without any extrapolation.
                                                                                                          
Model 26.3_5Reg is the final spatially explicit model, which models 5 management regions in Alaska (BS, AI, WG, CG, EG) and integrates mark-recapture tagging data to estimate movement.
